<p><div id="home_htm_lheader-content-view" class="card-slot content-view ALL TYPE-html SELF-home_htm_lheader d0-card-content" data-card-id="9922" data-card-name="HomeHTMLheader" data-card-type-id="50" data-card-type-name="HTML" data-card-link-name="HomeHTMLheader" data-slot-id="c2e10458e1a469eb80c0" data-slot="{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;,&quot;nest_name&quot;:&quot;HomeHTMLheader&quot;,&quot;nest_syntax&quot;:&quot;HomeHTMLheader&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:[&quot;content&quot;],&quot;home_view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;}"><center><div id="cdwcd_wimage02-content-view" class="card-slot content-view ALL TYPE-image SELF-cdwcd_wimage02 d0-card-content" data-card-id="27689" data-card-name="CDWCDWimage02" data-card-type-id="19" data-card-type-name="Image" data-card-link-name="CDWCDWimage02" data-slot-id="694c0b6bea2786b2a2d8" data-slot="{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;,&quot;nest_name&quot;:&quot;CDWCDWimage02&quot;,&quot;nest_syntax&quot;:&quot;CDWCDWimage02|float:left;size:large; padding: 0px 20px 15px 10px&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:[&quot;content&quot;],&quot;home_view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;large&quot;}"><img alt="CDWCDWimage02" src="https://production-storage.r1.cdn.objectstore.example/files/27689/135167-large.jpg" /></div></center><center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"><hr /></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"><strong>Culturesmith is a consultancy and online seminar devoted to building dynamic systems that live, learn, and work through conflict. </strong><strong style="text-align: right;">Leaders and teams practice <a class="known-card" href="/Conflict_Done_Well"><span class="card-title" title="Conflict Done Well">Conflict Done Well</span></a> in order to become continually more effective. </strong><strong>Individuals learn to understand the systems they live in, recover from trauma, and respond creatively to difference and stress.</strong></center><center style="text-align: left;"><hr /></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"><em><strong>We are accepting project proposals and new consulting clients at this time. Please <a class="known-card" href="/Make_Contact"><span class="card-title" title="Make Contact">Make Contact</span></a>.</strong></em></center><center style="text-align: left;"><hr /></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"></center><center style="text-align: left;"><strong>Please <a class="known-card" href="/Subscribe_to_my_newsletter"><span class="card-title" title="subscribe to our email list">subscribe to our email list</span></a> and <a class="known-card" href="/Conflict_Done_Well+Online_Classes"><span class="card-title" title="Zoom classes">Zoom classes</span></a> to learn about others who are exploring this work.</strong></center></center><center><br /><br /></center><center></center><center></center><center><span style="font-size: large;"><strong>Meet <a class="known-card" href="/Brandon_WilliamsCraig"><span class="card-title" title="Brandon Williamscraig">Brandon Williamscraig</span></a></strong></span></center><center></center><center><span style="font-size: large;"><strong><a class="known-card" href="/Recommendations"><span class="card-title" title="Recommendations">Recommendations</span></a></strong></span></center>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: large;"><strong><a class="known-card" href="/About"><span class="card-title" title="Learn more...">Learn more...</span></a></strong></span></p>
<center>&nbsp;</center></div></p>
<p><strong>If we just had a conversation that you found stimulating...</strong></p>
<p><div id="new_connection_ask-content-view" class="card-slot content-view ALL TYPE-rich_text SELF-new_connection_ask d0-card-content" data-card-id="2826" data-card-name="New Connection Ask" data-card-type-id="3" data-card-type-name="RichText" data-card-link-name="New_Connection_Ask" data-slot-id="3a76220d808320cbd59d" data-slot="{&quot;view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;,&quot;nest_name&quot;:&quot;New Connection Ask&quot;,&quot;nest_syntax&quot;:&quot;New Connection Ask&quot;,&quot;show&quot;:[&quot;content&quot;],&quot;home_view&quot;:&quot;content&quot;}"><p>Please do any or all of the following:</p>
<p>Join our at most biweekly email list by sending an email to brandon at culturesmith dot com.</p>
<p><a class="known-card" href="/Some_Help_Spreading_The_Word_Would_Be_Much_Appreciated"><span class="card-title" title="Some Help Spreading The Word Would Be Much Appreciated">Some Help Spreading The Word Would Be Much Appreciated</span></a></p>
<p>Use the <a class="known-card" href="/What_Do_We_Need_To_Know"><span class="card-title" title="What Do We Need To Know">What Do We Need To Know</span></a> area to write a brief endorsement we can use to interest others, based on what you like of my proposals, or a challenge (a bit of feedback of any kind) that helps us improve or cover new ground. If you feel inclined, I'd also love to know what thoughts, notes, tweets followed from our conversation, so I know what caught your attention and may respond to continue deepening the conversation. Let me know a) what I might be able to do for you, and b) what you need in general, whether or not you think I can help. This is also the spot for something you need us to know, but don't know where to put it.</p>
<p><a href="/account/signup">Sign up</a> for an account to this website. When you get the return acceptance, put info in your profile area including a sketch of your existing and planned projects.</p>
<p>Let the person who directed you to me know that you followed up and found our time together valuable. Thank her or him for the connection.</p>
<p>Enjoy selections from our <a class="known-card" href="/blog"><span class="card-title" title="work together">work together</span></a> by clicking here for</p>
